* for the ships that are small on screen (ship_sprite in main-code.a99):
* 8 frames of a tumbling pentagon in each of 3 sizes, and the space
* station. ti_setup_environment uploads the first 13 to sprite patterns
* 60 on, and the rest to 208 on.
*
